Design and develop attendance systems using PHP and MySQL.
a. student must be able to register himself
b. Teacher should be able to take attendance online using check boxes, roll no and name

1.Install XAMPP

Download and install XAMPP
https://www.apachefriends.org/index.html

2.Start services

Open XAMPP Control Panel

Start:
Apache
MySQL

3.Create project folder

Go to:
C:\xampp\htdocs\

Create folder:
attendance-system

Save file inside folder as:
index.php

4.Run project

Open browser:
http://localhost/attendance-system

5.Create database

Open browser:
http://localhost/phpmyadmin

Create database:
attendance

6.Create tables
Run SQL:
Go

7.Database connection in index.php

$conn = new mysqli('localhost', 'root', '', 'attendance');

Default XAMPP MySQL root password is empty

8.Project structure

attendance-system
│── index.php
